      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-225237",
      ":question/problem": "$f\u2261(x_{1}^(\u2015)\u2227x_{2}^(\u2015)\u2227x_{3})\u2228(x_{1}\u2227x_{2}\u2227x_{3}^(\u2015))\u2228(x_{1}\u2227x_{2}\u2227x_{3})$\n\nFill in the truth table for the Boolean function corresponding to the principal disjunctive normal form (PDNF) above.\n\n| $x_{1}$ | $x_{2}$ | $x_{3}$ | $f$ |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| $0$ | $0$ | $0$ | {{field-1}} |\n| $0$ | $0$ | $1$ | {{field-2}} |\n| $0$ | $1$ | $0$ | {{field-3}} |\n| $0$ | $1$ | $1$ | {{field-4}} |\n| $1$ | $0$ | $0$ | {{field-5}} |\n| $1$ | $0$ | $1$ | {{field-6}} |\n| $1$ | $1$ | $0$ | {{field-7}} |\n| $1$ | $1$ | $1$ | {{field-8}} |"
